OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph zones show drivers have
OL,4,Aslowed down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA study of eight areas where 20mph
OL,7,Fzones have been introduced has found
OL,8,Fdrivers were breaking the new speed
OL,9,Flimits but were travelling more slowly.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire County Council said
OL,12,Flower speeds were "statistically
OL,13,Fsignificant" in eight villages and
OL,14,Ftowns where speed signs have been in
OL,15,Fplace for at least 18 months.
OL,17,FThe authority has set aside #150,000
OL,18,Fper year for new 20mph schemes, with 25
OL,19,Falready in place and 29 being planned.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
