OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph zones show drivers have
OL,4,Aslowed down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report being presented to councillors
OL,7,Fon 1 September said: "All eight
OL,8,Flocations recorded statistically
OL,9,Fsignificant reductions in average
OL,10,Fspeeds."
